#: admin/siteguard-menu-rename-login.php:356
msgid ""
"This protects your site by changing the login page URL, making it harder for "
"automated attacks to find it. The default URL is “login_&lt;5 random "
"digits&gt;” and can be customized."
msgstr ""

#: admin/siteguard-menu-same-error.php:50
msgid "https://www.jp-secure.com/siteguard_wp_plugin_en/howto/same_error/"
msgstr ""

#: admin/siteguard-menu-same-error.php:85
